/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
294 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (Algorithm 2: Binary Spray & Wait DTN: Initializes payloads with L=16 tickets. In the "Spray" phase, a node halves its tickets with encountered peers. When L=1, it enters the "Wait" phase, physically carrying the bundle across radio dead zones [7], [9]. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
